      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Being able to stop an avatar download after it starts would also be a huge benefit.\nSometimes a 100+ MB avatar is starting to download, but if you hide it, turn on safe mode, or what have you, it'll continue to download.\nThis is especially frustrating when Everyone's avatar is 10-30 MB, but you've got one guy who's slowing the entire process down who you'd maybe like to load last or not at all (on a particular instance).\nObviously setting download limits is feasible, but sometimes 100 MB+ avatars are fine, in isolation, it's when there's a ton of them in a single world that this kinda issue crops up.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
